# BASH REQUIRED: This hook uses bash-specific features (set -euo pipefail,
# process substitution, [[ ]], etc.) and MUST be executed by bash >= 3.
# It will NOT work correctly under sh, dash, zsh, or other POSIX-only shells.
# Git uses the shebang line above to select the interpreter, so as long as
# bash is installed at /bin/bash the correct shell is always chosen.
# The $BASH_VERSION guard below provides a belt-and-suspenders safety net.
#
# Runs static-analysis lint scripts when relevant files are among the commits
# being pushed.  Each check is scoped to its own file-path pattern so that
# unrelated pushes remain fast.
#
# Checks included
# ───────────────
#   1. Email verify-step enforcement  — triggers on .github/workflows/**
#   2. Portal privacy SQL guard       — triggers on vite-functions-plugin.js
#                                       or prod-server.cjs
